      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just so anxious about it. my husband says i'm probably just overthinking it and that i should just take some hibiscus tea and try to sleep more instead of driving to the hospital at this hour. it's like 11pm. do you think i could just try some extra water and tea tonight and see if the swelling goes down by morning? if i feel any worse tomorrow i'll call them i promise.",
